# Ragshit ignores. Patterns are gitignore-style.
# Tracked files stay eligible even when .gitignore matches them, unless
# they are listed here explicitly.

.git/
.ragshit/
.zig-cache/
zig-out/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.img
*.bin
*.efi
*.elf
*.o
*.a
*.dylib
*.so
artifacts/efi-vars.bin

# The context engine itself (tools/ragshit/) is meta-tooling, not OS
# context: its README and sources contain OS query strings as examples and
# would pollute retrieval for this repository, so it is excluded from the
# OS index. (Subdirectory scoping is not supported; run ragshit against a
# standalone checkout to index the tool's own docs.)
tools/ragshit/
